# POS custom items & manual discounts

Cashiers on `/admin/pos` only (`requireAdmin`):

- One-off name/price (`allowCustomItems: true`)
- Manual `$` / `%` off, or a real promo code (`allowManualDiscount: true`)

Never add `customItems`, `allowCustomItems`, or `allowManualDiscount` to storefront cart or `/api/checkout` / `/api/stripe/payment-intent`. Checkout stays catalog + legit codes only.
